# Canonicalize hash-pinned files: prepare-adb.ps1 fail-closes on the
# SHA-256 of third_party/adb/LICENSE, so every checkout on every
# machine must produce byte-identical content regardless of the local
# core.autocrlf setting. The pinned bytes are LF.
third_party/adb/LICENSE text eol=lf
# The emulator matrix runner executes via a shebang on Linux CI; CRLF
# would break interpreter lookup, so its endings are pinned too.
launcher/emulator/run-matrix.sh text eol=lf
